<!--
  OpenAMRobot 2.0 combined robot description (ARCHITECTURE.md s3-5, ADR-001/004/005/006/008).

    base_link (platform-sw, included unchanged)
      -> mast_base_link -> mast_mount_link                      (mast.xacro, datums + mast_ids)
           -> mast_{left,right}_arm_mount_link                  (declared by the upstream macro, see below)
                -> openarm_{left,right}_* arms + grippers        (upstream openarm_v20_robot, one call per arm)
                     -> {left,right}_wrist_camera_*              (upper_sensors.xacro)
           -> head_camera_link / head_camera_optical_frame       (upper_sensors.xacro, on mast_mount_link)
           -> so101_mount_link                                   (arm_package == so101: stub, A9 owns the rest)
    world -> base_planar_joint -> base_link                      (only with enable_planar_base:=true)

  ros2_control (ros2_control.xacro): arms only, none for the base. hardware_profile picks the arm plugin: mock =
  mock_components/GenericSystem, gazebo = gz_ros2_control/GazeboSimSystem, real = openarm_hardware/OpenArmHW (ADR-003).

  Args: an unknown value for any arg fails expansion with the list of accepted values.
-->
